# Floors in detail (docs/guide/how-floors.md).
title: Every floor that applies either passes or blocks, and only a human-accepted waiver turns a miss into a waived result
direction: down
head: Pull request head, in the verify sandbox
applies: Does the floor apply to this change?
skip: skipped, with the reason in the pack
run: Pinned tool runs against its threshold
pass: pass: the floor holds
miss: fail or blocked: gate red, ship refuses
waiver: Accepted floor-waiver Decision
waived: waived: recorded, counted by audit
head -> applies
applies -> skip: no
applies -> run: yes
run -> pass: within threshold
run -> miss: over or tool error
miss -> waiver: human accepts
waiver -> waived
